menu "On-board UI"

    config EXTEND_SCREEN_UI_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Close the menu after this many seconds without touch (0 = never)"
        default 30
        range 0 600
        help
            While the menu is open the video is paused. It closes by itself after this time
            without touch (not while a finger is down).

    config EXTEND_SCREEN_POWER_EN_GPIO
        int "GPIO that keeps the board powered, driven low by Turn off (-1 = none)"
        default 20
        range -1 54
        help
            Board v1.2: GPIO 20 is the enable pin of the main voltage regulator. Turn off drives
            it low. If the board stays powered (for example from USB) the menu comes back.

endmenu
